WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.550
Quiz time!

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:03.690
"Who's Tonight's Star?"

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:09.460
Contestants, you'll get three clues...

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:09.980
Yes!

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:11.520
Not yet!

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.310
Don't answer just yet.

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:16.850
Try to guess who it is based on the clues.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.310
Um... Clue number one!

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:20.580
They're really strong.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.940
Yes! A demon!

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:22.850
Wrong.

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:24.440
A really strong demon!

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:26.630
It's not a demon. Next clue!

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:28.780
Their hair's pink and 
they're student council president.

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:29.670
Yes!

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:30.550
An odd demon!

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:31.790
An oddly colored demon!

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:33.940
I said it's not a demon!

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:35.870
And here's the last clue!

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:37.240
They're afraid of heights.

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:39.440
Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:41.200
Yes, go ahead, Teacher.

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:41.200
<i>Yes! I know! Yes!</i>

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.340
Demon! A very scary demon!

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:44.710
Everyone's scared!

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:48.500
Well then! This'll no doubt end in bloodshed!

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:50.020
<i>Demon! Demon! Really scary demon!</i>

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:53.280
Let's begin the third night 
of "Hayate No Gotoku!"

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:56.410
<b> Hakuo Academy</b>

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:56.410
 Student Council Notes

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:58.160
Give it to her yourself, Teacher.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:01.130
There's a reason I can't.

00:01:01.130 --> 00:01:02.450
And that is?

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:05.400
I didn't have enough for 
train fare yesterday,

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:07.880
so I borrowed 10,000 yen from Hina.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:09.750
Is it normal to borrow from

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:10.930
a sister in high school?

00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:12.420
Why not?

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:16.680
It worked since I said it was to cover 
train fare until my next paycheck.

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:20.010
<b><i><i> Yakitori</i></i></b>

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:20.480
But to my surprise, when I went to Shinjuku,

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:23.030
my 10,000 yen became 12 yen!

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:25.850
Why did you spend so much?

00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:28.230
Because I had 10,000 yen.

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:30.560
But you said it was for train fare!

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:32.020
Anyway!

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:34.910
I don't want Hina to 
yell at me, so please,

00:01:34.910 --> 00:01:37.360
you give this to her. Okay?

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:44.050
Hinagiku-san must endure 
so much hardship...

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:30.800
Hinagiku-san. I've got
 some papers for you.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:32.310
Huh? What's...

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:36.940
Hinagiku-san?

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:45.130
<i>How unusual for 
Hinagiku-san to fall asleep...</i>

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:49.180
<i>I wonder if she'll get 
mad if I wake her.</i>

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:51.170
<i>Should I leave her alone?</i>

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:52.830
<i>What should I do...?</i>

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:54.820
<i>What?</i>

00:03:54.820 --> 00:03:56.590
<i>What's the right thing to do?</i>

00:03:56.890 --> 00:04:00.210
<i>Well, she's sleeping soundly, so I...</i>

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:05.180
<i>Why? Why'd that happen?</i>

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:07.670
<i>I... I'm sorry. I'll quickly...</i>

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:10.720
What're you doing, Hayate-kun?

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:14.430
I am so sorry, Hinagiku-san.

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:16.860
The wind blew the papers...

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:19.130
I wasn't trying to disturb your nap.

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:20.940
Why are you so flustered?

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:23.650
I only asked what you were doing.

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:26.360
Yeah, I know, but...

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:28.450
I know, I know, Hayata-kun.

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:30.800
Hina is pretty scary.

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:32.450
Oh, Segawa-san and friends...

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:37.210
What? It's not like I'm always angry.

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:39.000
Maybe not <i>always</i>...

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:43.260
But you always yell at us 
when we do something wrong!

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:45.380
But of course!

00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:48.660
Isn't she scary, Hayata-kun?

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:52.320
You could be a bit nicer.

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:53.660
Um, well, er...

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:55.390
Okay.

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:57.900
Then I'll be nicer.

00:04:58.240 --> 00:04:59.400
Why are you here?

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:03.490
Um, well...

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:05.870
Forget it!

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:06.780
Hey!

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:10.600
What's going on?

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.230
Well, Hayate-kun?

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:15.410
I brought you papers from Ms. Katsura.

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:18.250
Oh, I see. Thanks.

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:21.610
So you had no reason 
to be so flustered.

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:24.440
Even if you'd woken me,

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:25.900
I wouldn't have gotten mad.

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:31.760
Yeah?  But you're quite 
scary when you're angry.

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:36.230
Well, I'm off, then.

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:41.860
<i>Oh... I get it.</i>

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:45.760
<i>I've put up a barrier to hide my true</i>

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:47.490
<i>feelings about Hayate-kun...</i>

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:53.320
<i>But now he just thinks 
I'm a scary girl.</i>

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:58.690
<i>So I need to be... nicer?</i>

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:02.750
Did you apologize?

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:05.900
It's Hina's favorite.

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:08.000
It's just so hard to admit...

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.140
...that we broke it playing tag.

00:06:13.960 --> 00:06:15.890
So that's what happened.

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:18.160
No, Hina!

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:21.240
Risa said we should play tag since 
we had nothing else to do!

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:22.730
Hey! That's not fair!

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:25.160
If you hadn't gone 
under the desk then...!

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:27.670
I-I didn't break it!

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:37.410
You'll get hurt if you 
play in such a small room.

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:41.330
Let's clean up.

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:44.370
You're not mad, Hina?

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:45.300
Mad?

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:47.040
Of course not.

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:49.550
I don't get mad over little things.

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:50.290
Uh...

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:52.530
What the?

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:56.320
Hey! Listen, Hinagiku.

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:57.830
Mr. Kaoru.

00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:01.140
She used all the money 
you lent her yesterday.

00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:04.840
And she keeps asking me for more.

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:07.570
Hey! What are you saying?

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:11.870
It's not true, Hina. 
I haven't spent it all.

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:13.820
I still have 12 yen. 12 yen!

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:15.330
Here.

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:18.440
Pay me back after you get paid.

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:19.240
What?

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:21.330
You're not going to yell at me?

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:24.560
Next time, budget better!

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:28.340
Weird...

00:07:28.930 --> 00:07:31.310
Little Miss Angry is so...

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:33.880
I can't believe she wasn't
 upset about the money.

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:37.170
You guys are so harsh.

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:41.960
First and foremost, 
Hinagiku is a gentle,

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:44.480
patient, and thoughtful person.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:47.480
She doesn't get angry for no reason.

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:51.670
You just think that 'cause 
you've never made her mad!

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:53.550
That's nothing to brag about!

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:54.230
Oh!

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:58.580
Maybe her anger is gonna increase...

00:07:57.140 --> 00:07:58.640
<i>Hinagiku gathers strength.</i>

00:07:57.140 --> 00:08:05.730
<i>Name
Hinagiku</i>

00:07:58.650 --> 00:08:03.600
<i>Hinagiku's strength increased by...</i>

00:08:03.030 --> 00:08:05.420
And then, the fateful blow...

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:05.730
<i>The fateful blow...</i>

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.510
I see.

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:10.130
That is possible.

00:08:10.410 --> 00:08:13.180
A land mine that could explode anytime

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:15.540
should be dealt with immediately.

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:17.260
But how?

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:20.490
By exploding it, of course!

00:08:21.590 --> 00:08:24.140
You want me to go to the 
movies with Hinagiku-san?

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:35.390
<b> Hakuo Academy</b>

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:26.290
Yeah, you see...

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:31.540
She's been in a super bad mood lately.

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:35.410
Is it because I interrupted 
her nap the other day?

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:39.460
What? Um, sure.

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:41.750
Yes, that's exactly why!

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:42.790
I knew it.

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:46.290
But times like these are 
what this movie is for!

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:47.790
<b><i>That's Meow</i></b>

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:47.790
<b><i>Kitty's Adventure Diary</i></b>

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:52.800
She's embarrassed about it, 
but she wants to see

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:56.300
this kids' film, "Kitty's Adventure Diary."

00:08:56.950 --> 00:08:59.060
Hina will be in a good mood again

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:01.310
if you take her, Hayata-kun!

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:04.880
It is a good idea, but...

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:07.190
You really think she'd go with me?

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:09.780
This is something only
 you can do, Hayata-kun.

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:12.700
You must put Hina in a good mood,

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:14.990
and cast a spell so she smiles.

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:17.070
This is a job only a true gentleman,

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:20.300
a butler among butlers, can accomplish!

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:23.080
Okay!

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:27.020
I'll put Hinagiku-san in a better mood!

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:32.840
That should do it.

00:09:33.290 --> 00:09:36.200
No doubt Hayata-kun will 
set off the land mine

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:38.220
that is Hina in a grand explosion!

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:42.350
<i>Be nice... Be nice...</i>

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:45.600
<i>If I'm nice, then I'm sure...</i>

00:09:46.570 --> 00:09:47.960
<i>One day, Hayate-kun will...</i>

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:51.980
Hinagiku-san!

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:53.860
Hayate-kun!

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.300
What's up?

00:09:57.090 --> 00:09:59.780
Would you like to go see a movie with me?

00:10:01.790 --> 00:10:04.540
Wh-What?

00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:06.420
<i>What is this?</i>

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:09.420
<i>Is it because I've been so nice?</i>

00:10:12.110 --> 00:10:13.670
Why ask now?

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:15.950
You don't want to?

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:18.090
Um, well...

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:23.970
<i>No, Hinagiku. Your efforts 
have actually worked!</i>

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:27.860
<i>This is the time for max honesty 
and cheerful kindness.</i>

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:33.580
Th-Thanks. I'd love to.

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:37.310
<i>She's so scary.</i>

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:41.950
<b>Connecting</b>

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:41.950
<b>Theater</b>

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:41.950
<b>Part A</b>

00:10:42.170 --> 00:10:46.750
The fur on the back of a cat's ear,

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:49.500
found here, is very soft.

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:53.380
I call it cat down.

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:55.860
<i>So what?</i>

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:00.630
<b>Connecting</b>

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:00.630
<b>Theater</b>

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:00.630
<b>Part B</b>

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:03.890
If you reflect the glare 
from a smart phone

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:07.910
onto the wall, and move 
it around like this...

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:11.190
Cats get all hyper and 
start chasing the light.

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:15.690
I call this my "Cat Phone" app.

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:18.190
<i>Again, so what?</i>

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:25.510
<i>To live as a nice person... huh.</i>

00:11:26.070 --> 00:11:29.460
<i>When you live this way...</i>

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:31.960
<i>...good things happen.</i>

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:40.470
This is the first time we've
 gone to the movies together.

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:44.470
<i>Wait... It's almost like...</i>

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:47.010
<i>...we're on a date, or something.</i>

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:49.850
You're going to the movies?

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:54.710
Tsugumi-san! Why are you here?

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:56.200
Wanna know?

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:58.780
If you wanna know, then take me, too.

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:01.480
Then I don't want to know.

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:03.280
Say you wanna know!

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:05.780
Who is she, Hayate-kun?

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:07.620
Well, she's...

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:10.030
My name is Ruri Tsugumi.

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:12.080
I'm Nagi Sanzenin's little sister!

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:14.080
Little sister?

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.090
Yes, that's righ—

00:12:16.430 --> 00:12:18.710
Sorry, don't mind her.

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:19.250
<i>Ow! Ow, ow, ow! Not the iron claw!</i>

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:21.100
One moment. I'll get rid of her.

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:21.140
<i>Not the iron claw!</i>

00:12:24.020 --> 00:12:25.570
Why are you here?

00:12:25.570 --> 00:12:27.060
I had no choice!

00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:29.540
My sister threw me out.

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:35.450
<i>30 Days of Soul Burning</i>

00:12:43.710 --> 00:12:45.990
<i>What are you doing?</i>

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:49.870
<i>You're not even supposed to be in here!</i>

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:52.860
<i>Your stuff is my stuff, big sister.</i>

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:55.790
<i>Of course, my stuff is just mine.</i>

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:57.540
<i>Get out!</i>

00:12:57.970 --> 00:13:00.410
So I was wandering around,

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:02.670
and lucky me, there you were!

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:05.710
What were you doing in the mansion?

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:07.700
Don't worry about that.

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:11.140
Anyway, I'm in the middle 
of an important job,

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:12.680
so don't bother me.

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:15.400
Take me with you! Please!

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:18.010
Take me to the movies with you!

00:13:18.010 --> 00:13:20.200
Ugh. Stop that.

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:20.810
<i>No!</i>

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:22.900
It's okay. Let's take her.

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:24.370
It's okay?

00:13:24.810 --> 00:13:28.160
Well, if a little kid wants 
to see it so badly...

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:31.060
So come on, let's go!

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:38.420
<i>I guess it's useless to get 
excited about things like dates.</i>

00:13:40.410 --> 00:13:42.920
<b>Kitty's Adventure Diary</b>

00:13:44.910 --> 00:13:46.810
There are so many kids.

00:13:46.810 --> 00:13:49.370
Well, it is a kids' movie.

00:13:50.460 --> 00:13:52.930
An adult! An adult is 
here to watch!

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.080
Is it a date?

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:55.980
It's a date! A date!

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:57.260
This is a date?

00:13:58.380 --> 00:13:59.730
You smooched yet?

00:14:00.030 --> 00:14:01.280
Have you?

00:14:02.050 --> 00:14:03.940
Kids are so innocent.

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:05.460
Yes, they are.

00:14:05.890 --> 00:14:07.130
Let's sit.

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:08.180
Y-Yes.

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:11.080
Have they done it?

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:12.530
I bet they have.

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:13.490
Nasty...

00:14:14.130 --> 00:14:17.640
<i>This isn't good. I've got to 
improve this situation somehow.</i>

00:14:23.350 --> 00:14:25.150
Sorry. Sorry.

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:26.380
Um, me too.

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:27.630
Always happens.

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:29.380
So innocent.

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:31.260
Such an important time 
in everyone's life.

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:33.600
Do you think they'll kiss?

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:36.270
They're such late bloomers!

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:39.040
Um, Hinagiku-san.

00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:41.270
I-I'm okay.

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:46.410
<i>I can't do anything but rely on 
 "Kitty's Adventure Diary."</i>

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:51.780
<i>I'm counting on you, 
"Kitty's Adventure Diary."</i>

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:53.780
<b><i> Kitty's Adventure Diary</i></b>

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:58.040
<i>A kitten, born only a short time ago,</i>

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:00.710
<i>was fighting for his life.</i>

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:03.560
<i>But God took pity on the kitten,</i>

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:06.280
<i>and gave him a mission in 
exchange for sparing his life.</i>

00:15:06.640 --> 00:15:08.460
<i>If the kitten promised to accept</i>

00:15:08.460 --> 00:15:11.340
<i>God's mission, then 
life would be granted.</i>

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:14.370
<i>Wow! I never would have 
expected this from a movie</i>

00:15:14.370 --> 00:15:16.430
<i>with a cheap title like 
"Kitty's Adventure Diary."</i>

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:18.460
<i>It actually looks interesting.</i>

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:29.470
<i>Why are you sleeping already?</i>

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:32.070
<i>You begged for us to take you!</i>

00:15:32.670 --> 00:15:36.400
<i>Your mission is to defeat the 
Demon King Labrador Retriever.</i>

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:38.000
<i>You can have a dangerous adventure,</i>

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:39.610
<i>or peace in heaven.</i>

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:41.500
<i>You choose.</i>

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:45.380
<i>I'm not sure what's going on, 
but I'll fulfill my mission!</i>

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:50.880
<i>And thus, Kitty's adventure 
to fulfill his mission began.</i>

00:15:51.120 --> 00:15:53.800
<i>I'm going to try my best!</i>

00:16:01.180 --> 00:16:02.690
Eh? Did the film break?

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:04.400
No way! Now what?

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:06.770
Let's show the video I shot at

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:08.440
my kid's school sports day.

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:12.950
 Movie Canceled

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:12.950
Sorry, Meow~

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:17.480
Whoa, what a strange twist.

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:24.460
<i>What is this? Am I cursed?</i>

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:26.960
<i>I can't believe all this craziness</i>

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:29.250
<i>always happens while 
I'm with Hayate-kun.</i>

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:33.310
<i>And if I throw a fit as usual, 
he'll hate me all over again.</i>

00:16:35.440 --> 00:16:38.750
<i>This isn't going to make 
Hinagiku-san happy.</i>

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:39.960
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:16:41.190 --> 00:16:43.600
<i>Cast a spell so she smiles.</i>

00:16:44.470 --> 00:16:45.480
Hinagiku-san.

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:48.240
Since this turned into such a mess,

00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:51.210
would you let me take you 
to one more place?

00:16:51.210 --> 00:16:53.040
Huh? Well...

00:16:54.590 --> 00:16:55.740
What about her?

00:16:56.300 --> 00:16:58.080
Let her sleep.

00:17:07.640 --> 00:17:09.500
I've been dreaming about

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:12.510
the happiness of seeing you

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:15.080
and the joy of hearing your voice.

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:18.190
My heart blossomed on that day.

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:21.100
Like an apple turning red,

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:26.940
your love gives my world color.

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:32.900
Wow!

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:34.900
So this is what it's like.

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:40.420
Since things went so 
crazy at the movies,

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:43.040
I wanted to take you to a 
place that can't go wrong.

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:48.560
Is this your first time 
here, Hinagiku-san?

00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:50.340
Yeah, my first.

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:54.280
Well, I've never been 
that interested.

00:17:54.890 --> 00:17:58.470
Beneath the costumes, they're
 just part time workers.

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:00.850
You're quite a realist.

00:18:01.170 --> 00:18:04.000
My dad used to say the same thing.

00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:06.850
That is, the dad who raised me.

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:10.340
A shark pops out, 
but it's just a machine.

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:13.010
The ghost is just a human in a costume.

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:16.860
A roller coaster has safety 
measures built in, so...

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:20.690
I wasn't sure how to have fun.

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:25.980
I see, I see.

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:29.520
Then I'll show you the real 
power of amusement parks.

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:32.410
What's gonna happen?

00:18:33.690 --> 00:18:35.410
Don't worry about it.

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:37.130
How long will it stay dark like this?

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:39.390
Don't worry about it.

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:43.640
We're here.

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:55.530
You idiot!

00:18:55.990 --> 00:18:57.780
Why'd you take me on that?

00:18:57.780 --> 00:19:01.030
You know I'm afraid 
of heights, right?

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:04.790
You've been acting so serious.

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:09.290
Learn from this, and let the park

00:19:09.650 --> 00:19:11.680
cast its magic spell on you!

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:28.990
I wish I knew a spell...

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:32.770
...to stop time forever.

00:20:09.710 --> 00:20:11.810
Wait!

00:20:13.370 --> 00:20:15.310
No, I won't wait.

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:19.170
There really is magic.

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:21.180
What?

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:22.800
Nothing.

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:23.950
What?

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:26.880
Nothing! Let's keep going!

00:20:56.750 --> 00:20:58.770
I had fun today.

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:00.330
I'm glad.

00:21:00.930 --> 00:21:04.520
You were nicer than usual today.

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:08.840
Why did you invite me out?

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:11.820
What? Um, well...

00:21:12.890 --> 00:21:13.750
Well?

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:22.520
I was asked to.

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:25.420
Hanabishi-san and the others

00:21:25.420 --> 00:21:27.930
said you've been in a 
foul mood, so they

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:29.260
asked me to do something.

00:21:31.140 --> 00:21:32.690
Oh... I see.

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.270
I get it.

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:38.340
Hinagiku-san?

00:21:40.190 --> 00:21:42.540
I think the spell has faded.

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:44.360
Let's go home.

00:21:46.650 --> 00:21:47.900
Wait!

00:21:49.050 --> 00:21:49.660
Huh?

00:21:50.390 --> 00:21:53.960
It's true that I was asked to do this,

00:21:53.960 --> 00:21:55.760
but I never thought you'd

00:21:55.760 --> 00:21:57.790
agree to go with me.

00:21:58.520 --> 00:22:02.920
I truly had a great time with 
you today, Hinagiku-san.

00:22:03.630 --> 00:22:05.010
Hayate-kun.

00:22:05.010 --> 00:22:13.140
It was really nice to spend time 
with you and see you having fun.

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:17.770
I was so happy, I got 
caught up in the fun myself.

00:22:18.350 --> 00:22:21.770
Which is why I feel like 
I need to tell you this...

00:22:22.210 --> 00:22:24.150
What? No...

00:22:25.010 --> 00:22:28.660
W-Wait! This is so
 sudden! You can't...

00:22:29.020 --> 00:22:32.440
I've been meaning 
to say this to you...

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:35.910
I'm not ready for this.

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:37.520
Hinagiku-san!

00:22:37.520 --> 00:22:38.570
Y-Yes!

00:22:40.180 --> 00:22:42.940
Will you lend me money 
for the train home?

00:22:45.010 --> 00:22:47.040
I spent all my money.

00:22:53.760 --> 00:22:55.910
So the land mine finally went off.

00:22:55.910 --> 00:22:58.770
Special effects these 
days are so impressive.

00:22:59.740 --> 00:23:02.020
Use your money wisely.

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:03.380
Sorry.

00:23:03.880 --> 00:23:06.810
You're too clueless, Hayate-kun.

00:23:06.810 --> 00:23:07.530
Pardon?

00:23:08.000 --> 00:23:12.030
Even if I'm invited to a 
movie I want to see, I'd...

00:23:16.190 --> 00:23:20.260
I'm sorry, I couldn't hear you. 
Could you say that again?

00:23:21.610 --> 00:23:25.050
Hm, I wonder what I said?

00:23:25.480 --> 00:23:27.980
Hey... Hinagiku-san?

00:23:28.780 --> 00:23:31.960
Maybe you'll hear it if 
you cast another spell.

00:23:37.420 --> 00:23:39.740
Look forward to the next episode!
